Z||000014||pontiacs4me||08-08-2001||04:29 PM||||these are my paragon hood vents, Im still in the process of making a good mold for them.  When I make them for sale they will be $70 per pair, shipping included to anywhere in the USA.  To date ive only made 3 sets of them, 2 sets turning out pretty rough.  I have 1 set that turned out really good, but they destroyed the mold, and they are going on my car.  1 set I gave to a friend to put on his lumina, and 1 set is for sale, but Ill tell you right now, it needs alot of smoothing to make them perfect.  My friend smoothed his out in about 3 hours.  Ill sell my last set for $35 shipped.  Heres what they look like.<BR> <A HREF="http://home.kscable.com/ccheney/ryanpict/gtpvents2.jpg" TARGET=_blank>http://home.kscable.com/ccheney/ryanpict/gtpvents2.jpg</A>  <A HREF="http://home.kscable.com/ccheney/ryanpict/gtpvents.jpg" TARGET=_blank>http://home.kscable.com/ccheney/ryanpict/gtpvents.jpg</A> <P>email me if you are interested.||||reg||1
